# The White Dragon visits each planet (one per failure or miss in the World, the agents and the Person Lab, none needing
# a real person), lights the library and lands green particles that become the nodes of that planet's 10x list.
LANGUAGE RSOS 0.2
WORLD cosmos
HOST lab KIND software CHANNELS visual
USE HOST lab
OBJECT library KIND room
BOOK all_knowledge SYMBOL golden_light AT library
LIGHT white_dragon OVER all ACTS find, show, heal, hear STYLE golden
FOUNDATION universal_knowledge DOMAINS biology, physics, information, statistics, medicine, engineering, history, cybernetics
OBJECT miss KIND module
PART miss.bear_lock KIND planet
PART miss.cue_loophole KIND planet
PART miss.transfer KIND planet
PART miss.repurposing KIND planet
PART miss.jam KIND planet
PART miss.repair_ceiling KIND planet
PART miss.attribution KIND planet
PART miss.outcome_grain KIND planet
PART miss.override_moments KIND planet
PART miss.stress_validity KIND planet
PART miss.rapport_power KIND planet
PART miss.context_data KIND planet
PART miss.adopt_confound KIND planet
PART miss.safety_reader KIND planet
PART miss.reader_independence KIND planet
PART miss.lineage_gaps KIND planet
PARTICLE niche_bear_lock LAND miss.bear_lock ON reward OPENS optimum_varies_by_context
TRANSPLANT niche_bear_lock TO miss.bear_lock DEPTH structure ORDER 1 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE refractory_cue_loophole LAND miss.cue_loophole ON open_cue OPENS cue_self_resolves
TRANSPLANT refractory_cue_loophole TO miss.cue_loophole DEPTH structure ORDER 2 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE rosetta_transfer LAND miss.transfer ON archetype_name OPENS map_by_measured_function
TRANSPLANT rosetta_transfer TO miss.transfer DEPTH structure ORDER 3 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE penicillin_repurposing LAND miss.repurposing ON failure_log OPENS screen_at_scale
TRANSPLANT penicillin_repurposing TO miss.repurposing DEPTH structure ORDER 4 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE kalman_jam LAND miss.jam ON signal_history OPENS state_space_forecast
TRANSPLANT kalman_jam TO miss.jam DEPTH structure ORDER 5 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE np_hard_repair_ceiling LAND miss.repair_ceiling ON benchmark OPENS instances_where_greedy_fails
TRANSPLANT np_hard_repair_ceiling TO miss.repair_ceiling DEPTH structure ORDER 6 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE counterfactual_attribution LAND miss.attribution ON decisive_step OPENS replay_with_step_fixed
TRANSPLANT counterfactual_attribution TO miss.attribution DEPTH structure ORDER 7 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE microscope_outcome_grain LAND miss.outcome_grain ON final_intensity OPENS turn_ratings
TRANSPLANT microscope_outcome_grain TO miss.outcome_grain DEPTH structure ORDER 8 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE microscope_override_moments LAND miss.override_moments ON word_overlap OPENS meaning_match
TRANSPLANT microscope_override_moments TO miss.override_moments DEPTH structure ORDER 9 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE si_units_stress_validity LAND miss.stress_validity ON reader_scale OPENS calibrate_to_self_report
TRANSPLANT si_units_stress_validity TO miss.stress_validity DEPTH structure ORDER 10 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE meta_analysis_rapport_power LAND miss.rapport_power ON one_corpus OPENS pooled_corpora
TRANSPLANT meta_analysis_rapport_power TO miss.rapport_power DEPTH structure ORDER 11 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE telescope_context_data LAND miss.context_data ON three_shards OPENS all_shards_and_support_corpora
TRANSPLANT telescope_context_data TO miss.context_data DEPTH structure ORDER 12 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE controlled_trial_adopt_confound LAND miss.adopt_confound ON placebo OPENS echo_matched_placebo
TRANSPLANT controlled_trial_adopt_confound TO miss.adopt_confound DEPTH structure ORDER 13 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE swiss_cheese_safety_reader LAND miss.safety_reader ON one_reader OPENS independent_layers
TRANSPLANT swiss_cheese_safety_reader TO miss.safety_reader DEPTH structure ORDER 14 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE replication_reader_independence LAND miss.reader_independence ON same_model OPENS different_method
TRANSPLANT replication_reader_independence TO miss.reader_independence DEPTH structure ORDER 15 GAIN tenfold
PARTICLE phylogenetics_lineage_gaps LAND miss.lineage_gaps ON single_record OPENS multi_session_public_data
TRANSPLANT phylogenetics_lineage_gaps TO miss.lineage_gaps DEPTH structure ORDER 16 GAIN tenfold
